        "original_id": "25ac6421-92a6-5a08-b419-6a3ba047c9a6",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: Bambi, The Country Bears\n- People: David Hand, Walt Disney, Felix Salten, Peter Hastings\n- Companies: Walt Disney Pictures\n- Topics: films, books, theme park attractions\n\nFacts:\n- Bambi is a 1942 American animated film directed by David Hand, who supervised a team of sequence directors.\n- Bambi was produced by Walt Disney and was based on the book \"Bambi, a Life in the Woods\" by Austrian author Felix Salten.\n- The Country Bears is a 2002 American family musical comedy film directed by Peter Hastings.\n- The Country Bears was produced by Walt Disney Pictures and was based on the Disney theme park attraction \"Country Bear Jamboree\".",
